Description: Implements Individual Conditional Expectation (ICE) plots for
    visualizing models fitted by supervised learning algorithms. ICE plots
    refine Friedman's partial dependence plot by graphing the fitted
    relationship between the predicted response and a feature for individual
    observations. They reveal variation in fitted values across the feature's
    range, helping identify where and to what extent interactions and other
    heterogeneous effects may be present.
